msgid "⟪k:0⟫I dunno...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wouldn’t even know where to begin..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Не знаю...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Я даже не знаю, с чего начать..."

#: scenario9:scenario9_F8E4206B_45DC_44F2_A387_5A9F5FCEF4D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88801cb9f391c9c39f589645c47f2add20d5ef39ec2c657fa9ce4b8776acf701
