#: scenario9:scenario9_D65D1FF3_4A42_4550_B79D_783F1577A93B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0abb448c1a1ea73811dae653e41e4853be14773648967a53233e2d592befe212
